ÿØÿÛ«symbol Fourier-Transform-SW
  «type: X»
  «description: Fourier Transform Sliding Window (Calculate Fourier Series Coefficient)»
  «library file: |.subckt Fourier-Transform-SW in an bn SynAna mag1 phase1\nB2 an 0 V=2/Tperiod * (idt(V(in)*cos(n*2*pi/Tperiod*time))-delay( idt(V(in)*cos(n*2*pi/Tperiod*time)), Tperiod, 2*Tperiod))\nB3 bn 0 V=2/Tperiod * (idt(V(in)*sin(n*2*pi/Tperiod*time))-delay( idt(V(in)*sin(n*2*pi/Tperiod*time)), Tperiod, 2*Tperiod))\nB4 SynAna 0 V=V(an)*cos(n*2*pi/Tperiod*time) + V(bn)*sin(n*2*pi/Tperiod*time)\nB5 mag1 0 V=hypot(V(an),V(bn))\nB6 phase1 0 V=-atan2(V(bn),V(an))*180/pi\n.param Tperiod=1/freq0\n.param n=1\n.ends Fourier-Transform-SW»
